# Content Repo Boundary Rule

This repository owns the static documentation content served at
`docs.haderach.ai`. It does not own the serving infrastructure or deployment
orchestration.

- Keep strict separation of concerns:
  - This repo owns static content files under `public/`, content structure, and
    documentation snapshots.
  - `haderach-platform` owns `content-api`, the GCS bucket, Terraform, and the
    deploy workflow.
- Do not add app business logic, Cloud Run service code, or ad hoc deployment
  scripts to this repository.
- Prefer explicit docs and simple content structure over heavy tooling.
- Use or update docs when behavior/contracts change:
  - `README.md`
  - `docs/architecture.md`
- Keep new structure minimal and production-minded.
- Production changes ship through the normal PR flow plus the platform-owned
  content deploy workflow; do not bypass it with manual GCP commands.
